# Fixed defect 2379, 2026-11-10, lane b29-pkgmsg, a shape beside it: a file
# of the package `core` calls `"x".mined()`, which only the program's own
# `other/strings` declares. It was told `unknown_function` with a near name's
# rename and a note on binding C; it is told the module and why no line of
